# falcon
===
 A blazing-fast, secure download manager. Supports HTTP/HTTPS, FTP, BitTorrent, cloud storage + (AWS S3, Alibaba Cloud), and private protocols (Thunder+QQDL). Features multi-threaded downloads, encrypted+credentials, and resume support.
